---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="About Collin Thoman - IT leader, amateur radio operator, and technology enthusiast based in Seattle" sideBarActiveItem="About">
  <div class="pb-2">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-base-content">About Me</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mt-1">IT leader by day, tinkerer by nature</p>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
        I'm Collin &mdash; an IT leader based in Seattle with 12+ years of experience building and managing
        technology teams. For me, technology isn't just a career; it's a genuine passion. The same curiosity
        that drives me to architect enterprise infrastructure at work has me tinkering with Home Assistant,
        standing up a private cloud, or building this very blog with Claude Code on the weekends.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
        I started my career at the Sno-Isle Skills Center studying Computers, Servers &amp; Networking, where I was
        nominated and inducted into the <strong>National Technical Honor Society</strong>. From there, I went through
        the ranks &mdash; Geek Squad field engineer, MSP consultant, system administrator &mdash; until I was promoted
        into a management role that was created based on my performance. That journey taught me that great IT
        leadership means staying close to the technical work while lifting the people around you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Drives Me -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-base-content mb-4">What Drives Me</h2>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
        Community, education, and professional development matter deeply to me &mdash; both inside and outside the
        workplace. I believe in investing in the next generation of IT professionals, which is why I serve on the
        <strong>Program Advisory Committee (PAC)</strong> for the Sno-Isle Skills Center's CSN program. I was recruited
        by my former teacher to join this committee of industry leaders who advise on curriculum and help shape
        the program that gave me my own start. It's one of the most rewarding things I do.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Outside the Office -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-base-content mb-4">Outside the Office</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-base-content">Overlanding &amp; Dispersed Camping</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          There's nothing like loading up and heading off-grid to explore the Pacific Northwest. Dispersed
          camping is my reset button &mdash; a way to disconnect from the busy world and reconnect with
          nature, whether solo or with friends.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8.111 16.404a5.5 5.5 0 017.778 0M12 20h.01m-7.08-7.071c3.904-3.905 10.236-3.905 14.14 0M1.394 9.393c5.857-5.858 15.355-5.858 21.213 0" />
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-base-content">Amateur Radio</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          Ham radio led me to volunteer with the Snohomish County Department of Emergency Management
          through the Auxiliary Communications Service. The incident response and management skills
          I've built there translate directly into how I handle IT incidents and crisis situations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-base-content">Tech Projects</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          My career and personal passion for technology are one and the same. Off the clock, you'll find me
          running Home Assistant, experimenting with private cloud setups, or building sites like this one
          to explore new tools and frameworks.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-base-content">Hosting &amp; Board Games</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          I love cooking and hosting friends for board game nights. Good food, good company, and a
          little friendly competition &mdash; that's a perfect evening.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-5 md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zm12-3c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zM9 10l12-3" />
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-base-content">Music &amp; Festivals</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          When I'm not in the backcountry or behind a keyboard, you might find me at a rave or music
          festival. It's a completely different kind of energy, and a great way to recharge.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's Next -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-base-content mb-4">What's Next</h2>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
        I'm currently learning Dutch and exploring IT leadership opportunities in the Netherlands and
        Belgium. With established connections in the Benelux region and a strong commitment to cultural
        integration, I'm excited about the possibility of bringing my experience to the EMEA market.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
        This blog is where I share what I'm learning along the way &mdash; from technical deep-dives
        and project write-ups to thoughts on IT leadership and the occasional adventure story.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Get In Touch -->
  <section class="mb-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-base-content mb-4">Get In Touch</h2>
    <p class="text-base-content/70 mb-4">
      I'm always happy to connect with fellow technologists, IT leaders, and anyone who shares similar interests.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="mailto:Collin.Thoman@gmail.com" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 mr-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
        </svg>
        Email
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/collinthoman/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 mr-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/>
        </svg>
        LinkedIn
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/collinthoman" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 mr-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
        </svg>
        GitHub
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
